# Vite entry points and the synced web fallback are build inputs/outputs we
# MUST track — the blanket *.html above silently removed them from git, which
# made `vite build` impossible on any fresh checkout (CI release never green).
!duty-agent-ui/index.html
!Assets_Duty/web/index.html

